---
import { KERSIVO_BOOKING_DEPOSIT_GBP, SAAS_MONTHLY_GBP } from '@/lib/seo/defaults';
import { SETORA_FACTS_CHECKED_DATE, getSetoraSource, requireVerifiedSetoraFact } from '@/lib/seo/setoraFacts';

const canonical = requireVerifiedSetoraFact('canonicalMonthlyGbp').value;
const trial = requireVerifiedSetoraFact('trialDays').value;
const pricing = getSetoraSource('pricing').url;
const barbers = getSetoraSource('barbers').url;
const websiteGuide = getSetoraSource('websites').url;
const savings = canonical - SAAS_MONTHLY_GBP;
---

<section id="setora-pricing" class="fresha-alt__section" aria-labelledby="setora-alt-costs-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="fresha-alt__intro">
      <p class="fresha-alt__eyebrow">SETORA PRICING EXPLAINED</p>
      <h2 id="setora-alt-costs-title" class="fresha-alt__h2">Setora pricing vs KERSIVO in the UK</h2>
      <p class="fresha-alt__lead">
        Both are subscription-led, direct-booking systems. Setora has one published paid plan,
        while KERSIVO offers a free Starter tier and Full software at a fixed per-location rate.
        Compare what is included and any separate Stripe, SMS or VAT costs.
      </p>
      <p class="fresha-alt-costs__checked">
        Setora pricing checked {SETORA_FACTS_CHECKED_DATE} ·
        <a href={pricing} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Official Setora pricing</a>
      </p>
    </header>
    <ul class="fresha-alt-costs__grid">
      <li class="fresha-alt-card fresha-alt-costs__item">
        <p class="fresha-alt-costs__kicker">SETORA STANDARD PLAN</p>
        <p class="fresha-alt-costs__figure">£{canonical}</p>
        <p class="fresha-alt-costs__unit">per location / month · no VAT currently added by Setora</p>
        <ul class="fresha-alt-costs__notes">
          <li>Unlimited staff, with no additional seat subscription fee.</li>
          <li>No Setora commission or additional client booking fee.</li>
          <li>Booking Page, Shop Website, diary, waitlist and kiosk workflow.</li>
          <li>SMS credits and Stripe payment processing are separate.</li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li class="fresha-alt-card fresha-alt-costs__item">
        <p class="fresha-alt-costs__kicker">SETORA FREE TRIAL</p>
        <p class="fresha-alt-costs__figure">{trial} days</p>
        <p class="fresha-alt-costs__unit">no card required to begin</p>
        <ul class="fresha-alt-costs__notes">
          <li>A temporary trial of the full Setora product, not an ongoing free tier.</li>
          <li>Month-to-month if you choose to continue.</li>
          <li>Shop Website and Booking Page are separate.</li>
          <li>Custom domain is available with Setora's assistance.</li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li class="fresha-alt-card fresha-alt-costs__item">
        <p class="fresha-alt-costs__kicker">KERSIVO STARTER</p>
        <p class="fresha-alt-costs__figure">£0</p>
        <p class="fresha-alt-costs__unit">per month · up to four bookable barbers</p>
        <ul class="fresha-alt-costs__notes">
          <li>Hosted booking page, staff, services and core customer tools.</li>
          <li>Public bookings require £{KERSIVO_BOOKING_DEPOSIT_GBP} deposit towards the service or payment in full.</li>
          <li>No KERSIVO commission. Stripe card-processing fees still apply.</li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li class="fresha-alt-card fresha-alt-costs__item">
        <p class="fresha-alt-costs__kicker">FULL KERSIVO</p>
        <p class="fresha-alt-costs__figure">£{SAAS_MONTHLY_GBP}</p>
        <p class="fresha-alt-costs__unit">per location / month</p>
        <ul class="fresha-alt-costs__notes">
          <li>Branded website and standard domain included.</li>
          <li>Advanced Clients, Reports and retail pickup on Full.</li>
          <li>No per-barber subscription fee, subject to fair use.</li>
          <li>Flexible payment rules; Stripe processing remains separate.</li>
        </ul>
      </li>
    </ul>
    <div class="fresha-alt-card fresha-alt-costs__marketplace">
      <div class="fresha-alt-costs__marketplace-body">
        <h3 class="fresha-alt-costs__h3">A fair subscription comparison</h3>
        <ul class="fresha-alt-list">
          <li>Based on the public standard rates, Full KERSIVO's software subscription is £{savings}/month less per location than Setora's main listed price, with separately charged payment processing and SMS excluded.</li>
          <li>Setora provides a waitlist, staff-operated walk-in kiosk and management apps — valuable tools you should evaluate separately.</li>
          <li>Setora offers an assisted custom domain, while Full KERSIVO includes a standard domain as part of the plan.</li>
          <li>Neither claims to bring customers through a consumer marketplace; both focus on direct booking.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="fresha-alt-costs__marketplace-aside">
        <p class="fresha-alt-costs__example">
          <strong>Current published terms.</strong> Setora's <a href={pricing} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">main pricing page</a> and <a href={barbers} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">barbershop page</a> both list £{canonical}/month. Its barber page says no VAT is currently added. Confirm billing terms before buying.
        </p>
        <p class="fresha-alt-costs__checked">Website details: <a href={websiteGuide} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Setora Help Centre</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="fresha-alt-costs__note">
      Setora advertises a separate NHBF promotional rate that is not the standard price. KERSIVO is not currently VAT registered and does not add VAT. This compares standard subscription prices only, not processing, messaging or operational costs.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
